                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nake nĩ ngwatĩlĩlyo ya ũtiĩwa witũ, kũvika wovosyo wa ala make mwene ala wathooie, nĩ kana ũtheu wake mũtisu ũkathwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.1.14",
